# {{PROJECT_NAME}} — agent instructions

This file is the entry point for any AI coding agent working in this repo.
Read the files below before making changes.

1. `PRODUCT.md` — what's shipped, and when.
2. `MEMORY.md` — project chronology and the decisions behind the current
   shape of the code. Check here before "fixing" something that might be a
   decision, not a bug.
3. `TASKS.md` — what's next. Don't pick up work that isn't listed here
   without checking with the user first.
4. `_spells/` — one active battle plan per in-flight feature, written by
   the planner and kept current by the orchestrator.

## The cast

This repo uses Aviomancy's persona harness. Each agent's full identity is
defined in its SOUL.md file under `.aviomancy/personas/` (or wherever this
project's personas were installed) and compiled into this tool's native
agent format. See `dashboard.html` for a live view of who's who.

